# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfstate.backup
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json
**/.generated/

# Generated inventories / fleet metadata (written by terraform apply)
**/ansible/inventory.ini
**/ansible/fleet.json
**/ansible/inventory/hosts.yml
**/inventory.ini
**/inventory.yml
**/inventory.yaml
**/fleet.json

# Local campaign cache (S3 sync / merge on laptop)
/results/
**/scripts/.cache/

# Secrets / operator-local values
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example
**/*.auto.tfvars
!**/*.auto.tfvars.example
**/*secret*
**/*credentials*

# Local backend config with account-specific bucket names
**/backend.hcl
!**/backend.hcl.example

# Operator campaign vars from last infra-apply (finish/destroy)
.campaign.env
